      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS FENDI (1) is generally an honest type in the frame at three of nine starts but missed the placings last time when fourth (21.94) over 390m at this track. Has never been beaten off this draw. Rates strongly and will go close from the inside draw. ATOMIC GHOST (2) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, breaking through last time at this track over 390m. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from four starts. Can make it two on the bounce. CANYA AURORA (8) comes off an average effort last start when fifth at Q Parklands over 520m behind Star Turn (30.20) in a Free For All. Scored at her previous run. The form out of last race has been strong. Likely to be about the mark. SASSY SIREN (3) is a last start winner who can measure up again.",
